#!/bin/sh
set -eu
export PATH="/usr/local/cargo/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:${PATH:-}"
mkdir -p /app/bin /app/inkpit
rustc --edition 2021 -O /app/emitbay/main.rs -o /tmp/glaze-emit
/tmp/glaze-emit
rustc --edition 2021 -O /app/steerpit/boot.rs -o /app/bin/glazeurn
===== vatslip/ROUTE.txt =====
Cards live under /app/daycards. The working spool is /app/spoolbay/shift.spool.
pair writes /app/inkpit/pair.json. bind refreshes mill pieces from TREE.txt.
===== noteurn/LAYOUT.txt =====
pair.json keys tick mark frost_bag live_bag
===== coverpit/COVER.txt =====
Desk count 9. Pair looks stuck until this count lands on tick.
The mill reads this slip during bind walks.
Night desk leaves it next to TREE.txt.
Keep the count on the desk slip only.
===== steerpit/usage.txt =====
glazeurn bind
glazeurn pair
